type: software
title: "enterprise-rag-patterns: Enterprise RAG Architecture Patterns with FERPA Compliance"
abstract: >
  Reference implementation of retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) patterns
  for enterprise environments operating under regulatory constraints.
  Includes FERPA-aware context policy with audit logging (34 CFR § 99.32),
  cross-channel session continuity, and governed AI escalation primitives.
